sequenceDiagram
    actor 顾客
    participant View as CliView
    participant VM as CoffeeMachineViewModel
    participant Service as CoffeeMachineService
    participant Repo as CoffeeMachineRepository

    顾客 ->> View: 输入“点单：拿铁”
    View ->> VM: make_coffee(0, 30)
    VM ->> Service: 验证库存 & 状态

    alt 库存不足
        Service -->> VM: 抛库存不足异常
        VM -->> View: 显示“咖啡豆不足”
    else 库存充足
        Service ->> Service: 扣库存、改状态为WORKING
        Service ->> Repo: save()
        Repo -->> Service: 保存成功
        Service -->> VM: 制作中(30秒)
        VM -->> View: 刷新视图

        note over Service: 30秒后计时器回调
        Service ->> Service: 恢复状态为IDLE、计数+1

        opt 计数达到5杯
            Service ->> 通知适配器: 推送清洁提醒
        end

        Service -->> VM: 制作完成
        VM -->> View: 刷新视图，显示“请取咖啡”
    end
